3],[30041,15.9,1999,69,86,25]],"links":[["Wheeler County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/oregon/wheeler-county"],["ARC or PLC in Wheeler County","/arc-plc/oregon/wheeler-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Wheeler County record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids July to August came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids saw June to July at 32% of normal and May to June at 39%. So far in 2026, May to June sits at 50% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 29142 had its driest year in 2002 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
